<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB ups Usinor to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB ups Usinor to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French steelmaker Usinor Sacilor was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In a resarch note, analyst Jeremy Fletcher said good first quarter revenues, strong forward order books and a recent surge in French spot steel prices all dispelled previous concerns about the company's outlook.</p>
<p>He set a year-end price target of 110 francs on the stock.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
